#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.4"
msgstr "v4.1.4"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.4 is a maintenance release built on Qt Creator 10.0.1, unchanged from "
"the previous release base. It carries an IDE version bump and a single "
"simplified-Chinese translation correction, with no functional or behavioral "
"changes. There are no breaking changes, and existing projects are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
"La version v4.1.4 est une version de maintenance construite sur Qt Creator "
"10.0.1, inchangée par rapport à la base de la version précédente. Elle "
"apporte une montée de version de l'IDE et une unique correction de "
"traduction en chinois simplifié, sans changement fonctionnel ni "
"comportemental. Il n'y a aucun changement incompatible, et les projets "
"existants ne sont pas affectés."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Maintenance release** — an IDE version bump and a simplified-Chinese "
"translation fix on Qt Creator 10.0.1, with no functional changes (`a2b5e627d"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a2b5e627d>`__, `86d59d69b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/86d59d69b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Version de maintenance** — une montée de version de l'IDE et une "
"correction de traduction en chinois simplifié sur Qt Creator 10.0.1, sans "
"changement fonctionnel (`a2b5e627d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a2b5e627d>`__, `86d59d69b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/86d59d69b>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:25
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Autres changements et améliorations"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Chinese translation fix** — corrected the simplified-Chinese rendering of "
"the ``Preferences...`` menu entry (`86d59d69b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/86d59d69b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Correction de la traduction chinoise** — correction du rendu en chinois "
"simplifié de l'entrée de menu ``Preferences...`` (`86d59d69b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/86d59d69b>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:32
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:34
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:37
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.4.rst:39
msgid "None. Existing projects, scripts, and workflows are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Les projets, scripts et flux de travail existants ne sont pas "
"affectés."
